# Notion integration token (needs access to the two Altiplano databases).
# In production this comes from the NOTION_API_KEY secret on the GitHub repo —
# never commit this file.
NOTION_API_KEY=ntn_...

// Dev-only: render the site from the local fixture dataset (src/lib/fixture.ts)
// instead of querying Notion. Helpful before the databases are shared, or for
// visual iteration without network. Works as a process env var too
// (USE_FIXTURE=1 npm run dev).
USE_FIXTURE=1